---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";

const title = "About HowToWriteYourMemoir.com";
const description =
  "Learn why HowToWriteYourMemoir.com was created and how it helps people turn life experiences into meaningful memoirs.";
---

<BaseLayout title={title} description={description}>
  <article>
    <p><a href="/">← Back to home</a></p>

    <h1>About HowToWriteYourMemoir.com</h1>

    <p>
      HowToWriteYourMemoir.com was created to help people transform their life
      experiences into meaningful, readable memoirs.
    </p>

    <p>
      Writing a memoir can feel overwhelming. A lifetime contains too many
      memories, too many people, and too many possible stories. The challenge is
      not simply remembering what happened. It is deciding what the story is
      really about and shaping those experiences into a narrative that matters.
    </p>

    <p>
      This website provides practical guidance for every stage of the process,
      from choosing a story and planning a memoir to writing, editing,
      publishing, and finding professional support when needed.
    </p>

    <h2>Who This Website Is For</h2>

    <p>This website is designed for:</p>

    <ul>
      <li>people writing their first memoir</li>
      <li>families preserving personal histories</li>
      <li>experienced writers developing a memoir</li>
      <li>professional memoir writers and ghostwriters</li>
      <li>memoir coaches, editors, and publishing professionals</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Our Approach</h2>

    <p>
      Every page begins with the questions a visitor is trying to answer.
      Content is designed to be clear, practical, encouraging, and useful.
    </p>

    <p>
      The goal is not simply to publish more articles. The goal is to help
      readers make real progress toward completing their memoir.
    </p>

    <h2>The Book</h2>

    <p>
      The website also supports the book
      <em>How to Write Your Memoir, Hollywood Style</em>, which brings the
      memoir-writing process together into one complete step-by-step system.
    </p>

    <p>
      <a href="/book/">Learn more about the book →</a>
    </p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
